{"version":1,"key":"card:50","content":{"id":50,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用中文输入时，未输入完成时，拼音会被作为输入，可能会达到意料之外的结果，比如有字数限制的时候，没有达到字数上限，但是由于拼音达到输入上限，因此会存在问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根本原因是我们需要一个能监听到中文输入法的事件，那就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"compositionstart ","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"compositionend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 事件。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"compositionstart","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示开始输入中文字符，而 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"compositionend","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示中文输入结束。"}]}],"tags":["DOM"],"createTime":1689000502467,"updateTime":1743303640387,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640387}}